  {
    "id": "R20",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.presentLevels",
    "value": "On the CELF-5 administered 05/06/2025, Maya obtained a Core Language Score of 71 (2nd percentile). Expressive Language Index 68; Receptive Language Index 79.",
    "note": "Speech-Language present level"
  },
  {
    "id": "R21",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.presentLevels",
    "value": "In class, Maya produces sentences of four to six words, omits verb tense markers, and does not retell a paragraph-length passage in sequence."
  },
  {
    "id": "R22",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.presentLevels",
    "value": "Teacher report: Maya does not raise her hand and gives one-word answers when called on."
  },
  {
    "id": "R23",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.presentLevels",
    "value": "The parent reports that Maya has become reluctant to speak in class and at home about school.",
    "note": "the 'Parent input' paragraph of the present levels"
  },
  {
    "id": "R24",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.teamNotes",
    "value": "The parent asks that speech-language therapy remain at the current level and that the district assess written expression, which was not assessed in May 2025.",
    "note": "the 'Parent input' paragraph of the present levels — what the parent asked for"
  },
  {
    "id": "R25",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.goals",
    "value": "Goal 1 - Expressive Language. By 08/20/2026, given a picture sequence, Maya will retell a four-event narrative using complete sentences with correct past-tense verb forms in 4 of 5 trials, as measured by SLP data collection. Baseline (05/2025): 1 of 5 trials."
  },
  {
    "id": "R26",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.goals",
    "value": "Goal 2 - Classroom Participation. By 08/20/2026, Maya will respond to a teacher question with a complete sentence of five or more words in 8 of 10 opportunities across two class periods, as measured by teacher tally. Baseline: 2 of 10."
  },
  {
    "id": "R27",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.services",
    "value": "Speech-Language Therapy: 60 minutes per week, individual, provided by a licensed speech-language pathologist in the speech room, 08/21/2025 to 08/20/2026."
  },
  {
    "id": "R28",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.services",
    "value": "Specially Designed Instruction - Written Expression: 45 minutes per week, small group, provided by an EC teacher in the resource room, 08/21/2025 to 08/20/2026."
  },
  {
    "id": "R29",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 1,
    "field": "iep.placement",
    "value": "Maya will be in the regular education setting for 92% of the school day. Removal is limited to speech-language therapy and resource instruction."
  },
  {
    "id": "R30",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 2,
    "field": "iep.teamNotes",
    "value": "Grace Okafor (Parent); Daniel Whitfield (LEA Representative, Assistant Principal); Ana Lucero, M.S., CCC-SLP (Speech-Language Pathologist); Robert Chen (EC Teacher); Kim Aldana (Regular Education Teacher, English Language Arts).",
    "note": "the 'IEP team' list"
  },
  {
    "id": "R31",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 2,
    "field": "iep.teamNotes",
    "value": "The IEP team proposes to continue speech-language therapy at 60 minutes per week and to add 45 minutes per week of specially designed instruction in written expression.",
    "note": "under 'Prior written notice of the IEP team decisions'"
  },
  {
    "id": "R32",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 2,
    "field": "iep.teamNotes",
    "value": "The team declined the parent's request to reevaluate written expression, on the basis that the 05/06/2025 evaluation is current and the added instruction addresses the concern.",
    "note": "under 'Prior written notice of the IEP team decisions'"
  },
  {
    "id": "R33",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 2,
    "field": "iep.teamNotes",
    "value": "The parent may request an independent educational evaluation if the parent disagrees with the district's evaluation.",
    "note": "under 'Prior written notice of the IEP team decisions'"
  },
  {
    "id": "R34",
    "docId": "01_IEP_Pine_Hollow_2025-08-21",
    "page": 2,
    "field": "iep.teamNotes",
    "value": "The parent signed the IEP on 08/21/2025 and wrote: \"I agree with the services. I still want written expression tested.\""
